---
source: crates/diroxide-core/src/filter/tests.rs
expression: lints
---
typed: *.txt *.md
said: Both patterns must match one name. Use a comma or or.

typed: *.txt and *.md
said: Both patterns must match one name. Use a comma or or.

typed: sise 10 MB
said: No field named sise. Did you mean size?

typed: modifed today
said: No field named modifed. Did you mean modified?

typed: kind folder and kind file
said: Nothing can match this filter. kind is folder and kind is file cannot both be true.

typed: ext pdf ext txt
said: Nothing can match this filter. extension is pdf and extension is txt cannot both be true.

typed: size over 10 MB and size under 1 MB
said: Nothing can match this filter. size over 10 MB and size under 1 MB cannot both be true.

typed: hidden and not hidden
said: Nothing can match this filter. hidden and not hidden cannot both be true.

typed: modified today and modified last week
said: Nothing can match this filter. modified today and modified last week cannot both be true.

typed: label urgnt
said: No label named urgnt. Did you mean Urgent?

typed: label zzz
said: No label named zzz. Labels: Urgent, Waiting, Review, Done, Keep, Skip in searches.

typed: size between 5 MB and 1 MB
said: The range runs from high to low. It is read as from 1 MB to 5 MB.
